          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Heightened rivalry leads state and partisan media in both camps to spotlight and frame Israel–Palestine events as proxy or strategic issues, increasing volume and prominence of coverage." />
