          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising systemic U.S.–China geopolitical tensions reduce China's willingness and perceived neutrality to host or participate in third‑party mediation and divert diplomatic bandwidth from envoy initiatives, lowering the intensity and frequency of mediation efforts." />
