          <attvalue for="34" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An increased perceived probability of regional military escalation triggers fast portfolio rebalancing across equities, bonds, FX and commodities (including option hedging), driving realized and implied volatility higher across asset classes." />
