          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Widening sovereign credit spreads constrain fiscal space and political capital for regional governments and external donors, reducing their willingness or capacity to undertake robust reciprocal diplomatic measures (e.g., sanctions escalations, mission changes) in disputes over settlements." />
