          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Widening sovereign credit spreads for a belligerent or a principal donor (e.g., Ukraine or key backers) creates acute fiscal financing pressure and urgency to unlock external support, increasing that party's willingness to make concessions and enter negotiations." />
